# tesseract.js's Node cache default: it downloads *.traineddata to the
# process's cwd on first worker creation (confirmed locally — a plain
# `createWorker("eng")` wrote a ~5MB eng.traineddata straight into this
# repo's root). See utils/ocr.ts for the full runtime implication.
